# Verified stage pauses for Sherlock v46

Goal: let the generic staged investigation transfer context and reach validated reports on Winevtx and a fresh independent corpus. No final report acceptance rules change.

Evidence: r9 closed triage at 12:39:23; Stop reinjected a final-report substance error at 12:39:33 despite the required handoff. Driver sent Escape at 12:39:54; clear ran before the old provider response completed at 12:39:59. Four requested tools lacked completion hooks; guardian faulted at 12:40:03. Runtime has no stage-pause allowance and the driver cancels after 20 seconds.

Runtime v46: copy immutable v45. checkpoint handoff writes a durable one-use pending-handoff receipt bound to boundary sequence, partial/full kind, source/destination stage, and canonical handoff text hash. Stop validates safe receipt/checkpoint/handoff paths and matching durable boundary before final-report validation. Permit only partial non-done stages or full triage→draft / draft→repair. Verify current worklist seals/counts and no active child before pause. Consume receipt atomically, preserve active marker, and return a distinct stage-pause reason. Invalid or consumed receipts do not grant allowance. repair→done never grants a pause; all existing final report gates and exact final delivery remain required. Document that a stage pause is not final success. Do not modify v45.

Driver: monitored operation must wait for natural idle, never send Escape and never type while busy. Existing external controller/guardian and 600-second request watchdog remain responsible for cancellation on actual faults. No aggregate time/call/cost cap. Check child process liveness while waiting and stop cleanly on exit. Keep legacy behavior isolated. Preserve clear/session/skill/reseed evidence checks.

Acceptance: regressions reproduce missing allowance and premature cancellation; valid full/partial handoffs preserve marker and cannot replay; malformed/stale/state/hash mismatches refuse; active children refuse; final placeholder still refuses and valid final delivery retains all four gate checks. Driver delayed-idle regression proves zero Escape/typing until idle, process exit stops without typing, and supervisor stop still terminates owned processes. Actual installed Qwen fixture must exercise stage handoff Stop plus delayed provider/tool completion before clear. Existing focused clear-proof tests pass. Subscription qualification then target-model partial, full Winevtx, and cold independent corpus on one frozen final package hash.

Non-goals: new orchestration framework, relaxing missing-tool checks, seeded findings, broad cleanup, production changes.
